{
  "name": "tiger",
  "_about": "THE REFERENCE SCULPT (2026-11-04, docs/engines.md 'the sculpt overlay'): the cat frame's rig, drawn by shapes written for a tiger -- long and low, a deep keel of a chest under heavy shoulder blades, massive forearms on big round paws, a lean loin with the loose belly skin under it, a high rump on thick thighs; a broad head that is mostly cheek, flared with a white ruff, short round ears black behind, a white-padded muzzle on a pink nose; the rig's own long tail kept. Stripes are the coat shader's (coatpat.js): along the body frame on the trunk, across each leg's own on the limbs, stacked on the brow (2026-11-05 review pass, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/tiger.py: the face's markings as seated decals, broader stripes -- patScale 1.28 -- black ear backs with their white spot, ringed tail end, a smaller white jowl and throat)",
